> [WHAT][:][ This][ 6][ day][,][ 5][ night][ retreat][ includes][ an][ exciting][ three][ day][ challenge][-][by][-][choice][ R][opes][ Course][,][ camp][ fires][,][ creative][ expressions][,][ all][ while][ making][ friends][ with][ Un][ite][ens][ from][ throughout][ the][ Northwestern][ Region][.][
][WHO][:][ All][ Un][ite][ens][ must][ be][ 11][ and][ have][ finished][ 6][th][ grade][ and][ be][ no][ more][ than][ an][ 8][th][ grade][ graduate][.][ Un][ite][ens][ must][ have][ attended][ at][ least][ 4][ Un][ite][en][ meetings][ or][ be][ a][ new][ member][ of][ the][ church][.][ All][ Un][ite][ens][ and][ counselors][ must][ sign][ the][ Heart][ Ag][reements][ agreeing][ to][ follow][ these][ Group][ Ag][reements][.][
