> [C][ust][ó][d][io][,][ Leonardo][ (][2014][)][ Types][ of][ fa][vel][a][ media][ activism][.][ Fa][vel][as][@][L][SE][ (][18][ Sep][ 2014][).][ Blog][ Entry][.][
][C][itizen][ participation][ and][ collective][ action][ through][ the][ use][ of][ media][ are][ not][ new][ phenomena][,][ but][ they][ are][ more][ topical][ than][ ever][ in][ the][ global][,][ hyper][connected][ public][ sphere][.][ In][ this][ post][,][ Leonardo][ Cust][ó][d][io][ discusses][ his][ research][ on][ the][ rich][ media][ activity][ produced][ by][ fa][vel][a][-][based][ activists][.][ He][ shows][ how][,][ through][ community][ media][,][ media][ collect][ives][ and][ networks][ of][ mutual][ support][ and][ joint][ action][,][ fa][vel][a][ dwell][ers][ have][ been][ able][ to][ take][ control][ of][ communication][ channels][ and][ platforms][ to][ raise][ their][ own][ voices][ and][ demands][.]

