> [The][ Fal][mouth][ University][ community][ is][ spread][ over][ two][ campuses][ -][ Pen][ryn][ and][ Fal][mouth][,][ which][ are][ connected][ by][ frequent][ bus][ services][ and][ a][ train][ line][.][ We][ offer][ a][ variety][ of][ accommodation][ in][ Pen][ryn][ and][ Fal][mouth][.][
][Please][ see][ the][ Halls][ of][ Res][idence][ page][ for][ full][ information][ on][ our][ halls][ of][ residence][ and][ information][ about][ costs][ and][ contract][ lengths][.][
][Applications][ for][ accommodation][ open][ on][ Wednesday][ 10][th][ April][ 2019][ at][ 12][pm][ and][ are][ made][ via][ our][ online][ booking][ system][ -][ Room][ Service][.][
][To][ be][ able][ to][ apply][ for][ accommodation][ you][ must][ have][ firmly][ accepted][ a][ course][ offer][ with][ Fal][mouth][ University][ as][ your][ first][ choice][.][
