> [Paul][a][ Anderson][ was][ certified][ as][ a][ Master][ Clinical][ Hyp][n][other][apist][ in][ 2000][ and][ immediately][ opened][ her][ private][ practice][.][ Prior][ to][ that][ she][ received][ her][ B][FA][ in][ C][ello][ Performance][ and][ was][ a][ professional][ musician][.][ Since][ 2000][ she][ has][ participated][ in][ several][ advanced][ and][ cutting][-][edge][ train][ings][ and][ seminars][,][ always][ with][ an][ intention][ of][ deepening][ her][ understanding][ of][ human][ experience][ and][ consciousness][.][ All][ of][ this][ informs][ her][ work][ and][ the][ consciousness][ and][ respect][ she][ brings][ to][ her][ sessions][.]


